@startuml

actor User
participant Client
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Mapper
database Database

User -> Client: 提交保存图书类别信息请求
activate Client
Client -> Controller: 发送保存图书类别信息请求
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: 调用保存图书类别信息方法
activate Service
Service -> Mapper: 保存图书类别信息
activate Mapper
Mapper -> Database: 插入图书类别信息
activate Database
Database --> Mapper: 返回插入结果
deactivate Database
Mapper --> Service: 返回插入结果
deactivate Mapper
Service --> Controller: 返回插入结果
deactivate Service
Controller --> Client: 返回插入结果
deactivate Controller
deactivate Client

@enduml
